  "date": "2026-06-05",
  "author": "Kanok Miah",
  "excerpt": "Discover why SEO is essential for e-commerce success in Bangladesh — from Daraz sellers to Shopify stores, learn how organic search drives sustainable growth.",
  "tags": [
    "E-commerce SEO",
