  "title": "Technical SEO Checklist for Bangladeshi Websites",
  "date": "2026-05-28",
  "author": "Kanok Miah",
  "excerpt": "A complete technical SEO checklist for Bangladeshi websites — covering Core Web Vitals, mobile optimization, site structure, and common issues that hold local sites back.",
  "tags": [
