  "title": "How to Choose the Right SEO Agency in Bangladesh",
  "date": "2026-05-20",
  "author": "Kanok Miah",
  "excerpt": "A practical guide to choosing the best SEO agency in Bangladesh — what to look for, red flags to avoid, and questions to ask before signing a contract.",
  "tags": [
    "SEO Agency",
